					<description><![CDATA[I didn&#039;t know that cerebral paly is a non progressive disorder.
Meaning the the brain damage is not progress. 


NB.In Uganda Asphyxia is the most leading cause of cerebral palsy]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I didn&#8217;t know that cerebral paly is a non progressive disorder.<br />
Meaning the the brain damage is not progress. </p>
<p>NB.In Uganda Asphyxia is the most leading cause of cerebral palsy</p>
